{"step_index":5713,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-09-25T10:56:44Z","thinking":"Group 1712's inode table location is identified. Inode 14027084's index within the group is calculated and this helps pinpoint its corresponding block in the inode table.  The filesystem block associated with this inode is calculated, determining that it is located at 56099024. The next step involves searching the journal for descriptor tags related to block 56099024.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"run_command","args":{"CommandLine":"\"python3 -c \\\"\\nimport struct\\n\\nwith open('/tmp/journal.copy', 'rb') as f:\\n    journal = f.read()\\n\\nBLOCK_SIZE = 4096\\nnum_blocks = len(journal) // BLOCK_SIZE\\n\\nTARGET_FS_BLOCK = 56099024\\nprint(f'Searching for filesystem block {TARGET_FS_BLOCK} in journal transactions...')\\n\\nmatches = []\\nb_idx = 1\\nwhile b_idx < num_blocks:\\n    block = journal[b_idx*BLOCK_SIZE : (b_idx+1)*BLOCK_SIZE]\\n    magic, btype, seq = struct.unpack('>III', block[:12])\\n    if magic == 0xC03B3998 and btype == 1:\\n        # Descriptor block\\n        pos = 12\\n        tag_idx = 0\\n        while pos + 16 <= BLOCK_SIZE:\\n            blk_lo, flags, blk_hi, csum = struct.unpack('>IIII', block[pos:pos+16])\\n            fs_block = (blk_hi << 32) | blk_lo\\n            data_b_idx = b_idx + 1 + tag_idx\\n            if fs_block == TARGET_FS_BLOCK:\\n                matches.append((seq, b_idx, data_b_idx))\\n            tag_idx += 1\\n            pos += 16\\n            if flags & 8:\\n                break\\n        b_idx += 1 + tag_idx\\n    else:\\n        b_idx += 1\\n\\nprint(f'Found {len(matches)} journal records for block {TARGET_FS_BLOCK}!')\\nfor seq, desc_b, data_b in matches:\\n    print(f'   Seq {seq}: desc block {desc_b}, data block {data_b}')\\n\\\"\"","Cwd":"\"/home/azureuser\"","WaitMsBeforeAsync":"5000","toolAction":"\"Finding inode table block in journal\"","toolSummary":"\"Find inode table block in j